# MongoDB to Oracle Migration Solutions

This project provides three distinct solutions for migrating MongoDB applications to Oracle Database:

## 1. Simple Migration
The basic migration solution is located in [solutions/simple-migration](mdc:mongo-migration/solutions/simple-migration/README.md). It provides:
- Traditional migration using `mongodump` and `dbms_migrator`
- Python-based direct migration utility
- Basic data integrity verification

## 2. Complex Migration
The advanced migration solution is in [solutions/complex-migration](mdc:mongo-migration/solutions/complex-migration/README.md). It handles:
- Complex MongoDB features (aggregations, geospatial queries)
- Schema transformations
- Performance optimization
- Advanced verification

## 3. AI/Analytics Enhancement
The AI-enhanced solution is in [solutions/ai-analytics](mdc:mongo-migration/solutions/ai-analytics/README.md). It adds:
- Excel-based analytics
- Oracle Select AI integration
- Vector processing capabilities
- AI-enhanced application features

## Common Components
All solutions share:
- MERN application setup using [docker-compose.yml](mdc:mongo-migration/solutions/simple-migration/docker/docker-compose.yml)
- Python migration utilities in [mongodb2ora_migrationtools](mdc:mongo-migration/mongodb2ora_migrationtools)
- Configuration files in respective `config/` directories
- Logging in respective `log/` directories
